OL,3,GNEWSASensors installed to monitor how  
OL,4,Apeople get around                      
OL,6,FSensors to detect cyclists,            
OL,7,Fpedestrians, and vehicles are being    
OL,8,Finstalled in a town.                   
OL,10,FWest Berkshire Council is introducing  
OL,11,Fsix sensors, funded for a three-year   
OL,12,Fperiod by Active Travel England, in    
OL,13,FThatcham.                              
OL,15,FThey will be mounted on lamp columns to
OL,16,Fmonitor how people get around.         
OL,18,FLiberal Democrat councillor Stuart     
OL,19,FGourley told BBC Radio Berkshire: "We  
OL,20,Fwant to be able to make sure that we   
OL,21,Fmake good data-based decisions on how  
OL,22,Fwe improve our active travel links."   
